        ['Can this combine with other iComply services?', 'Yes. AI, ads, SEO, creative and automation are often packaged so channels reinforce each other under one plan.']],
],

'it-support' => [
    'name' => 'IT support',
    'long' => 'IT support for SMEs and marketing stacks',
    'icon' => 'cpu',
    'meta_title' => 'IT Support for UK SMEs & Marketing Stacks | iComply',
    'meta_desc' => 'Practical IT support for UK SMEs: email, domains, Microsoft 365, website hosting, DNS, backups and the tools your marketing relies on.',
    'h1' => 'IT support that keeps marketing and operations online',
    'lede' => 'Email that works, domains that renew, websites that stay up, and the SaaS stack behind your ads and CRM — supported by a team that understands how marketing breaks when IT drifts.',
    'intro' => [
        'Marketing fails quietly when DNS is wrong, inboxes bounce, tracking scripts die after a host change, or nobody owns Microsoft 365 licences. Many SMEs bounce between a distant MSP who does not understand campaigns and a marketing agency who will not touch IT. We bridge that gap for the systems that earn and process leads.',
        'Our IT support focuses on the practical layer: domains and DNS, business email, website hosting and SSL, device basics, password and MFA hygiene, backups, and the marketing tools chain (CMS, CRM, call tracking, tag managers). We document what you have, fix what is fragile, then retain for monitoring and changes.',
        'For deeper infrastructure, cyber assurance or on-site server projects we will say so and can introduce a specialist — aligning with how the wider iComply group refers professional work. Day to day, you get a named contact who answers when a form stops posting or Google cannot verify your domain.',
    ],
    'pains' => [
        'Marketing tools break after a hosting or DNS change',
        'No clear owner for domains, DNS and email authentication',
        'Staff IT issues interrupt campaigns and client work',
        'You outgrew “friend who knows computers” but do not need a huge MSP',
    ],
    'included' => [
        ['Stack audit', 'Domains, DNS, email, hosting, devices and marketing tooling inventoried.'],
        ['Email and domain health', 'SPF, DKIM, DMARC, renewals and registrar hygiene.'],
        ['Website and SSL care', 'Uptime basics, updates coordination, staging discipline.'],
        ['Microsoft 365 / Google Workspace help', 'User setup, MFA, shared mailboxes, light admin.'],
        ['Marketing stack glue', 'Tag manager, CRM embeds, form endpoints and call tracking kept alive.'],
        ['Backup and recovery checks', 'Critical data and site backup verification.'],
        ['Secure access habits', 'Password manager, MFA and least-privilege for agencies and staff.'],
        ['Retainer support hours', 'Named channel for tickets with agreed response times.'],
    ],
    'process' => [
        ['Discover', 'Inventory and risk list from a short audit.'],
        ['Stabilise', 'Fix email auth, DNS, backups and single points of failure.'],
        ['Document', 'Simple runbook so you are not dependent on one person’s head.'],
        ['Retain', 'Ongoing support and change control for the stack.'],
    ],
    'measure' => ['Critical incidents per month', 'Email deliverability / bounce rate', 'Site uptime', 'Time to resolve marketing-stack tickets', 'Assets with MFA enabled'],
    'fit' => 'Fits owner-managed SMEs and marketing-led teams who need reliable email, web and SaaS without a heavy enterprise MSP — especially when campaigns depend on tracking staying intact.',
    'related' => ['websites-landing-pages', 'email-marketing', 'marketing-strategy'],
    'faqs' => [
        ['Are you a full managed service provider?', 'We cover the SME and marketing-stack layer well. Large network, firewall or compliance-heavy estates may need a specialist MSP — we will tell you honestly.'],
        ['Do you support Mac and Windows?', 'Yes for common business setups. Line-of-business industry software is supported on a best-effort or specialist-referral basis.'],
        ['Can you take over our GoDaddy / IONOS / Cloudflare domains?', 'Yes. We document access, fix DNS properly and stop accidental sales-driven migrations.'],
        ['Will you rebuild our whole IT estate?', 'Only if needed. Most clients need stabilisation and a retainer, not a rip-and-replace.'],
        ['How does this relate to Professional Services IT consultants?', 'iComply Professional Services helps end clients find IT professionals. This Marketing service is hands-on support we deliver for your business and marketing systems.'],
        ['What is the response time?', 'Agreed in the retainer. Critical email or site-down issues are prioritised over cosmetic requests.'],
    ],
],

'linkedin-tiktok-ads' => [
    'name' => 'LinkedIn & TikTok ads',
    'long' => 'LinkedIn and TikTok advertising',
    'icon' => 'megaphone',
    'meta_title' => 'LinkedIn & TikTok Ads Management for UK Businesses | iComply',
    'meta_desc' => 'LinkedIn ads for B2B lead gen and TikTok ads for awareness and leads. Creative, audiences and conversion tracking for UK SMEs.',
