    'intro' => ['LinkedIn and TikTok are not interchangeable. LinkedIn works when you need job titles, industries and company sizes. TikTok works when creative and cultural relevance beat precise firmographics. Running both under one lazy “social ads” label wastes budget.', 'We build LinkedIn campaigns around lead gen forms, website conversions and ABM-style account lists. TikTok campaigns centre on hooks, native creative and spark ads where creators help. Tracking, UTMs and CRM hand-off are set before spend scales.', 'Creative is treated as the product: talking-head explainers, offer-led clips and static carousels tested weekly. You get clear reporting by platform so you can see which channel earns the right leads.',
