        'Because iComply also runs operational service businesses, we design marketing systems that survive busy weeks: clear owners, sensible SLAs and hand-offs your staff will actually use. That practical bias shows up in every retainer we run.'],
    'pains' => ['LinkedIn spend brings impressions but soft leads', 'TikTok feels relevant but nobody owns a performance setup', 'Creative looks like interrupted TV ads and gets scrolled past', 'B2B and consumer offers are mixed in one campaign structure'],
